      "changelog": "- Initial release of the \"英语综合测评\" (Comprehensive English Assessment) skill.\n- Enables teachers to assess students' English abilities systemically based on the CEFR framework (A1–C2), focusing on listening, speaking, reading, and writing.\n- Provides workflows for ability profiling, assessment design, CEFR mapping, and targeted teaching interventions.\n- Emphasizes capability mapping over traditional scoring, supporting comprehensive \"4-skill\" coverage and individualized reports.\n- Interfaces with related student analysis and lesson planning modules for integrated teaching insights.",
